/UI_WC_Rules_Step01Description,"Choose a country to represent among the 32 registered nations.

When you select a country, you will gain an avatar, background, banner, and title to customize your player card and represent your country. At the end of the competition, the winning country will add a star to their player card background.

You can also select your team's Set or Palette in the customization menu to represent your country on the pitch.",
