/UI_WC_Rules_Step02Description,"Every week, your country will face another in a <Bold_Light>Match Phase</>. Play games in any mode other than custom match to win more <Bold_Light>Match Points</> than the opposing team and qualify for the next phase.

Both teams will get Battle Pass Tokens at the end of the phase, and the winning country will get more.

If your country's total points is too low, you will get a <Bold_Light>catchup bonus</> to help you stay competitive, even against the bigger countries.",
