ST_Loca_NewsFeed/UI_NewsFeed_NewFastChat_Description,"During a match, press <action id=""ComsCategory1""/>, <action id=""ComsCategory2""/> or <action id=""ComsCategory3""/> to open a category : compliment, tactical or apologies. Press an input again to select and send one of the 3 communications.

At the end of game, the wheel changes so you can send GG to your teammates!
 
You can rebind those inputs, or go back to the previous 4-coms system, in the remapping settings.",
