ST_Loca_NewsFeed/UI_NewsFeed_003_FirstSeason_WelcomeV1,"Welcome to Rematch Season 0 !

This is just the beginning for Rematch, we are already hard at work on the next patches and updates, and we have plenty of ideas for improvements, new content and more. 

We will be analyzing all feedback from the community to make sure we're going in the right direction, so please share any comments/suggestions via the link in the menu! 

Thanks for joining us, we hope you will enjoy the game ! 

Sloclap ",
