ST_LocaUI_Contracts/UI_Contract_Rules_Step2Description_01,Your <Bold_Light_Italic>actions on the pitch</> are tied to Badges: everything you do <Bold_Light_Italic>contributes</> to the corresponding <Bold_Light_Italic>Badge</>. Explore your <Bold_Light_Italic>collection</> and discover what kind of player you are.,
