ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_010,"<action id=""LockInput""/>DEFENSIVE STANCE is an essential tool to intercept passes and shots, win duels, and to mark opponents efficiently.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_020,"<action id=""TapInput""/>TAP can also be used to shoot at goal, which can catch goalkeepers off guard.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_009,"After a sliding tackle, it takes a while to get back up and become active again. Use them carefully.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_005,Give your teammates space. Chasing the ball will create empty spaces for your opponents to exploit.,
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_018,"Goalkeeper and sweeper shots cannot be intercepted by outfield players, they will be slightly deflected instead.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_023,Goalkeepers and sweepers have infinite stamina.,
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_014,Goalkeepers are invulnerable for a few seconds after receiving the ball from another player.,
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_017,"Goalkeepers become 'sweepers' when leaving their area. They cannot handle the ball anymore but keep their stamina and shoot bonuses, making it safer to intercept balls higher on the pitch.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_002,Goalkeepers can tackle their own teammates to handle the ball and keep it safe.,
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_022,"If you are losing by a single point at the end of the timer, you will get one LAST ACTION. It ends when your team loses possession of the ball.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_006,"Keep an eye out for unmarked enemies, try to reduce the space you give them.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_004,"Making runs and being active in your positioning will attract defenders, breaking down their marking and defensive shape.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_024,"Once goalkeepers catch a ball, they can't catch it again until an opponent interacts with it.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_019,"Quick passing is essential: get used to passing to teammates outside of your vision with <action id=""MoveInput""/> <action id=""TapInput""/>TAPS.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_015,Sideway passes do not bring the ball forward but are efficient at breaking down the opposing defense.,
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_007,Staying high up on the pitch allows to receive passes and counter-attack quickly but will leave your teammates in inferior numbers and vulnerable.,
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_003,The Goalkeeper role can quickly be switched during the game by exchanging which player is in the penalty area.,
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_016,The extra effort gauge refills faster when stamina is full.,
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_001,The goalkeeper is also the last defender: surge out of your area to intercept balls that are closer to you than to the attacker.,
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_013,"The lower your stamina, the lower your sprint speed.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_021,"When a team leads by 4 goals, the game is instantly ended by the MERCY RULE.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_008,"When opponents stay high up on the pitch, they have less players defending. Exploit this with careful passes.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_011,"When you have the ball in your feet, you are vulnerable to tackles. Try to play quickly, with fast passes and push balls.",
ST_LocaUI_LoadingTips/UI_LoadingTip_012,"You are slower when in possession of the ball. Use <action id=""PushballInput""/>PUSH BALL to push the ball forward, allowing you to go faster.",
