ST_LocaUI_OptionsVideo/UI_OptionVideo_GrassQuality_Description,"Sets the quality of grass. At high value, grass is more visible and detailed. Lowering grass quality improves performance.",
ST_LocaUI_OptionsVideo/UI_OptionVideo_PostProcessQuality_Description,"Sets the quality of post processes such as motion blur, depth of field, ambient occlusion... Lowering post process quality improves performance.",
ST_LocaUI_OptionsVideo/UI_OptionVideo_ShadowQuality_Description,"Sets the quality of shadows. At high value, shadows are rendered at higher resolution and are displayed at a higher distance. Lowering shadow quality improves performance.",
ST_LocaUI_OptionsVideo/UI_OptionVideo_AntiAliasingQuality_Description,Sets the quality of the anti-aliasing post-process. Lowering anti-aliasing quality improves performance.,
ST_LocaUI_OptionsVideo/UI_OptionVideo_CrowdQuality_Description,Sets the quality of the stadium crowd. Lowering crowd quality improves performance.,
ST_LocaUI_OptionsVideo/UI_OptionVideo_TextureQuality_Description,"Sets the quality of the textures. At high values, textures are more detailed but use more memory. Lowering texture quality improves performance.",
ST_LocaUI_OptionsVideo/UI_OptionVideo_EffectsQuality_Description,Sets the quality of visual effects. Lowering effects quality improves performance.,
