ST_SeasonEnd/UI_NewSeason05_Description,"The long-awaited collaboration with Blue Lock is finally here! This special season features a new game mode, gameplay updates, and Blue Lock-themed skins and outfits. Time to start farming aura! And remember: to win in Rematch, even the most egoist strikers need to play together !",
ST_SeasonEnd/UI_NewSeason02_Description,"This season introduces 1 vs 1 Duel mode, first as a temporary game mode, and soon as an option in custom games. Player locomotion has been updated, with more reactive transitions, and a new dribble to push ball mechanic. Expect more gameplay updates in future patches, more news soon !",
ST_SeasonEnd/UI_NewSeason03_Description,"This season introduces new periodic challenges and the ability to team up at the end of games. Full list of core gameplay tweaks & fixes in the patch notes. These are the final weeks of training before the Rematch Nations Cup 2067, coming in June - time to lock in!",
